/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:13:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:14:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:15:- The grid has a dominant background color and one non-background marker color
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:16:  that appears as exactly two cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:17:- The marker cells are aligned either in one row or one column and both lie
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:18:  in the same half along that direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:19:- Other non-background pixels are content inside one or both halves.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:20:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:21:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:22:- If the markers share a row, keep the left or right half whose columns
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:23:  contain them.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:24:- If the markers share a column, keep the top or bottom half whose rows
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:25:  contain them.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:26:- In the kept half, recolor the marker pixels to the background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:27:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:28:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:29:- The two marker pixels are not part of the picture; their alignment and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:30:  half-position identify which half of the doubled canvas is the answer.
