/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:36:Rewrite a corner L block into two nested L borders and a diagonal trace.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:37:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:38:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:39:A rectangular grid has exactly two colors: one color forms a one-cell-thick
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:40:L on two adjacent outer edges, and the other color fills the remaining
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:41:rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:42:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:43:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:44:Normalize the L to the top-left corner. Paint the outer top-left L with the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:45:fill color, the next inner L with the original border color, and the main
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:46:diagonal of the remaining inner rectangle with the fill color. All other
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:47:cells become color 8, then the original orientation is restored.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:48:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:49:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:50:The corner of the input L determines the orientation; after flipping to a
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:51:canonical top-left L, the output is the same nested-layer pattern for every
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:52:example.
