/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:67:- Fill the whole output with the background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:68:- Use the quadrant of the center-colored pixels to choose one diagonal
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:69:  direction from the center.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:70:- Draw a continuous line of the center color from the center to the grid
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:71:  edge in that direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:72:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:73:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:74:The color at the exact center identifies the surviving color, while the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:75:other pixels of that color identify which corner the center should connect to.
