/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:100:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:101:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:102:- Black background with isolated colored pixels and teal (8) pattern components.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:103:- A rule example is a 4-neighbor colored pair source->target whose continued
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:104:  direction reaches an anchor touching a teal pattern component.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:105:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:106:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:107:- For each rule example, copy that teal component onto every other pixel of
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:108:  source.color, recoloring the copied component to target.color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:109:- Translation maps the rule anchor onto the source pixel being replaced.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:110:- Remove teal components and all pixels used by rule examples.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:111:
