/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:120:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:121:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:122:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:123:- The largest foreground color forms several one-pixel-thick rectangular lattice frames.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:124:- The frame lines divide each lattice into the same row-by-column set of rectangular slots; some slots already contain one non-frame color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:125:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:126:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:127:- Infer a color for each logical slot position from the colored slots across all lattice frames.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:128:- Repaint every slot interior in every lattice with the inferred color for its row/column position.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:129:- Keep the frame lines and all background outside frames unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:130:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:131:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:132:- Slot sizes vary by frame, but the complete color pattern is indexed by lattice slot position rather than by absolute pixel size or location.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:133:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:134:</reference_puzzle>
