/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:139:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:140:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:141:The input is a rounded rectangular frame: the four corners are the background
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:142:color, and every other outer-border pixel has one frame color. Non-background
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:143:pixels inside that frame are the motif to preserve.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:144:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:145:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:146:Make a 5x5 version of the rounded frame with a 3x3 interior. Crop the input
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:147:interior motif to its bounding box, center that crop in the 3x3 interior, and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:148:paste the resulting 5x5 icon at upper-left positions (2, 2) and (8, 8) in a
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:149:15x15 background canvas.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:150:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:151:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:152:The variable-size frame is only a carrier; the meaningful object is the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:153:compact interior motif, which is normalized to the fixed 3x3 icon interior.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:154:</description>
