/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:159:Stamp recolored sprites into a framed region using placeholder positions and a color legend.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:160:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:161:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:162:- bg background, a rectangular single-color frame, colored placeholder cells inside the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:163:- Outside the frame: sprite shapes (one per placeholder color) and a small legend mapping each placeholder color to an output color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:164:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:165:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:166:- Find the frame and its interior placeholders.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:167:- For each placeholder color, locate the matching-color sprite outside the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:168:- Stamp each sprite at the placeholder's position inside the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:169:- Recolor every stamped sprite to the output color defined by the legend.
