/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:193:Extend each solid foreground rectangle toward its same-color isolated pixels with capped one-cell paths, clearing each original marker pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:194:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:195:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:196:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:197:- Each foreground color has exactly one solid rectangular object and one or more isolated same-color marker pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:198:- Every marker is horizontally or vertically aligned with the rectangle bbox and lies outside it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:199:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:200:- For each marker, draw a one-cell-wide straight path from the adjacent side of the rectangle through one cell beyond the marker.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:201:- Add a three-pixel perpendicular cap at the rectangle end and around the marker endpoint.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:202:- Recolor the original marker pixel to background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:203:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:204:- The isolated pixels are not copied; they mark the hollow endpoints of capped protrusions grown from their matching rectangle.
