/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:210:Predict the next panel in a framed sequence by continuing each scheduled colored interval.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:211:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:212:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:213:- The grid is made from three or more equal panels in one row or one column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:214:- The final input panel is the static target template; every earlier panel differs from it only by dynamic colors absent from the template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:215:- Each dynamic color appears in a regular temporal schedule across the earlier panels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:216:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:217:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:218:- Keep the final template panel as the output canvas.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:219:- For every dynamic color whose schedule reaches the next panel, compare its last two appearances.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:220:- Extrapolate each one-dimensional interval along the color's changing row or column axis and paint that predicted mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:221:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:222:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:223:- The task is not asking for the last visible panel, but for the next frame after the blank/template slot.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:224:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:225:</reference_puzzle>
