/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:297:Shift each interior pixel whose color matches a frame side one cell toward that matching side.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:298:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:299:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:300:The grid has a one-cell-thick rectangular frame: the four corners are the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:301:background color, and each side between corners is a solid, distinct side
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:302:color. The interior is mostly background with sparse foreground pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:303:
