/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:307:move one column right. A pixel already adjacent to its matching side stays in
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:308:place; colors that do not match a frame side and the frame itself are unchanged.
