/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:318:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:319:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:320:- The background surrounds a top legend, one solid non-background separator row, and a lower marker field.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:321:- The legend contains equal-size filled square sprites, with a singleton marker below each sprite and aligned to its center column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:322:- The lower field contains only background and marker colors from the legend.
