/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:335:Fill the small background compartments bounded by the long contour color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:336:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:337:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:338:- The grid has one dominant background color and two foreground colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:339:- The more frequent foreground color forms long 8-connected contour fragments.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:340:- The other foreground color is a fixed distractor/obstacle color that partitions
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:341:  the background but is never recolored.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:342:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:343:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:344:- Split the background into 4-connected regions using all foreground pixels as
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:345:  barriers.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:346:- Keep the two largest background regions as the outside of the contour drawing.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:347:- Recolor every other background region that touches a long contour component
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:348:  to the contour color; leave all foreground pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:349:
