/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:351:The apparent area fill is exactly a component-level fill of bounded background
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:352:compartments, not a row-wise interpolation between individual contour pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:353:</description>
