/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:361:The grid has a dominant background color, a two-color top row, and all
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:362:foreground pixels below the top row lie in the first column as vertical markers.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:363:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:364:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:365:Keep the input top row as output row 0 and the first marker row as output row 1.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:366:Output row 2 is background except at the top-row foreground columns, which are
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:367:recolored pink.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/11/prompt.md:368:
